{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>Allen</i>, a cat with a bad attitude and a perfect life at the pet shelter. The humans? Annoying. The other animals? Tolerable. The only thing that matters is doing whatever you want\u2014knocking things over, claiming the best nap spots, and making sure no one forgets who\u2019s in charge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cause Chaos</strong> \u2013 Swipe things off tables, trip humans, and create havoc wherever you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Treats</strong> \u2013 Find hidden treats in every level to flex your mischievous skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun the Chaos</strong> \u2013 Complete levels as fast (or as ridiculously) as possible while creating total mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Your \u201cForever Home\u201d</strong> \u2013 Each level, your goal is simple: get adopted\u2026 and then immediately get yourself returned by causing enough chaos to drive your new owner mad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allen has everything he needs right here\u2026 and he\u2019s not about to let anyone ruin it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and embrace the chaos!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570840?t=1759408744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570840/cf274e7feb9fcb5ddd154d61f833cff9c17beb25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759408744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570840/60c398d64dd410f69633810390aaeb744a676cd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759408744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570840/60c398d64dd410f69633810390aaeb744a676cd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759408744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}